---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { PAGE_META, SITE, SOCIAL } from '../consts';
---

<BaseLayout
  title={PAGE_META.about.title}
  description={PAGE_META.about.description}
  showRightAside={false}
>
  <article class="about">
    <h1>About</h1>
    <p>
      I'm <strong>{SITE.author}</strong>, a software engineer with a background in graphics
      and visual effects rendering. I'm spending the next six months transitioning into
      a <strong>Forward Deployed Engineer</strong> role, with a focus on the
      <strong>education</strong> vertical.
    </p>

    <h2>Why FDE</h2>
    <p>
      The best engineers I know are not the ones with the most abstract knowledge —
      they are the ones who can sit in a customer's messy reality and ship something
      that actually helps. That is what an FDE does. I want to be that kind of engineer.
    </p>

    <h2>Why education</h2>
    <p>
      I've spent years rendering pixels. The shift to rendering <em>understanding</em> —
      helping a teacher see a student's specific misconception, helping a student
      unstuck on a single problem — feels like the right next chapter.
    </p>

    <h2>How to follow along</h2>
    <p>
      I publish a weekly log on the <a href="/journey/">journey</a> page and longer
      essays on the <a href="/blog/">thoughts</a> page. Reach out if any of it
      resonates:
    </p>
    <ul>
      {SOCIAL.map((s) => (
        <li><a href={s.href} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{s.label}</a></li>
      ))}
    </ul>

    <h2>Why this site looks the way it does</h2>
    <p>
      This site borrows from a few people whose work I admire. The article list is
      shaped after <a href="https://shud.in">Shu Ding</a>'s ideas waterfall. The home
      page takes cues from <a href="https://delba.dev">Delba de Oliveira</a>'s clean
      two-column layout. The article body and footnote system follow
      <a href="https://leerob.io">Lee Robinson</a>'s typography.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about {
    max-width: 640px;
  }

  .about h1 {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-8);
  }

  .about p {
    color: var(--text);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .about ul {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .about li {
    padding-left: var(--space-4);
    position: relative;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
  }

  .about li::before {
    content: '·';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
</style>
